# Audio applications and instrument/effects packages. The video branch keeps
# the audio runtime (PipeWire, libjack-jackd2-0, osspd) because editors and OBS
# need it, but it does not ship a DAW, a soft synth, or a guitar rig.
#
# This list replaces the audio branch's 02-video-optical.list. Do not purge
# kdenlive, melt, MLT, subtitleeditor, devede or k3b here: they are the video
# product.
